    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before she was a smol survivor, Witchy led a glorious life as a mushroomancer capitalist. She used her magic spells to cultivate and sell various fungi and fungi related products. She constructed maker stations using mycelium to maximize said profits. When she needed some assistance, she would donate to the elemental shrines to increase her magical abilities and expand the fungal fields for even more profit! But first, she had to pay of her abhorrent rent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time pressure, time doesn't really flow well here. You've still a debt to repay though.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different mushroom variants to grow and process for maximum profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 spells that can be upgraded to help maximize profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 makers that can be used to turn raw mushrooms into new food, alchemic, and construction product to maximize profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maximum profit.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before she was a smol survivor, Witchy led a glorious life as a mushroomancer capitalist. She used her magic spells to cultivate and sell various fungi and fungi related products. She constructed maker stations using mycelium to maximize said profits. When she needed some assistance, she would donate to the elemental shrines to increase her magical abilities and expand the fungal fields for even more profit! But first, she had to pay of her abhorrent rent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time pressure, time doesn't really flow well here. You've still a debt to repay though.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different mushroom variants to grow and process for maximum profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 spells that can be upgraded to help maximize profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 makers that can be used to turn raw mushrooms into new food, alchemic, and construction product to maximize profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maximum profit.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Embrace fungal capitalism in this casual 2.5D mushroom management sim starring Witchy the smol mushroomancer from before she became a smol survivor in her journey to obtain maximum profits by tapping into her mycelium roots.",
